"description": "DXC Technology Co. engages in the provision of technology consulting, outsourcing and support services. It operates through the Global Business Services (GBS) and Global Infrastructure Services (GIS) segments. The GBS segment provides technology solutions that help clients address challenges and accelerate the digital transformations that are tailored to each client's specific objectives. The GIS segment offers a portfolio of technology offerings that deliver predictable outcomes and measurable results while reducing business risk and operational costs for customers. The company was founded in 1959 and is headquartered in Ashburn, VA.",
